      ],
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Product Details",
        "body": "<p>Order custom DTF gang sheet printing with Fineyst Transfers. Upload your completed, print-ready gang sheet and get vibrant, ready-to-press transfers for t-shirts, hoodies, team apparel, and other compatible fabrics.</p><p>Our VIVID+ DTF printing process uses an expanded CMYK + RGBO + White ink system to produce rich colors, smooth gradients, crisp whites, and sharp details.</p><p>Whether you're printing multiple designs for your clothing brand, business, or team, Fineyst makes DTF gang sheet ordering simple. Choose your sheet size, upload your artwork, and place your order online.</p>",
        "subheading": "Super Vivid Prints. No Upcharge.",
        "subbody": "<p>Get professional-quality DTF gang sheet printing with Fineyst VIVID+ technology.</p><p>Our 9-color printing system is designed to deliver vibrant colors, detailed artwork, and smooth gradients. VIVID+ printing is included with every qualifying standard DTF gang sheet order at no additional upgrade cost.</p><h3>Price Calculator</h3>"
      }
    },
